  "18+ years of financial market experience",
  "Structured learning path (MDC1 → MDC2 → MDC3)",
  "Beginner to advanced curriculum",
  "Live market education",
  "Practical, rule-based trading methods",
  "Personalized mentorship",
  "Strong focus on risk management",
  "Professional trading discipline",
