---

<BaseLayout
  title="What We Teach"
  description="A complete curriculum overview from Money Door FX Academy — Gold and Forex trading, technical analysis, our proprietary PR & PC strategy framework, risk management, and more, taught across MDC1, MDC2 and MDC3."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="What We Teach"
    title="Master the Global Financial Markets"
    subtitle="Structured trading education designed to help aspiring traders understand how the financial markets work — technical knowledge, practical market analysis, disciplined risk management, and live market learning, whether you're a beginner or an experienced trader."
  />

  <section class="surface-gold py-section">
    <Container width="wide" class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/75 sm:text-lg">
        At Money Door FX Academy, we provide structured trading education designed to help
        aspiring traders understand how the financial markets work. Our training combines
        technical knowledge, practical market analysis, disciplined risk management, and live
        market learning.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/75 sm:text-lg">
        Whether you are a beginner or an experienced trader, our curriculum is designed to build
        confidence through education, practice, and continuous learning — across sixteen areas of
        the curriculum, taught progressively through MDC1, MDC2 and MDC3.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="surface-ink py-section">
    <Container width="wide" class="flex flex-col gap-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)]">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Full Curriculum"
        title="Sixteen Areas of Practical Trading Education"
        align="left"
      />
      <div class="grid gap-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.5rem)] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-stagger>
        {
          topics.map((t) => (
            <div class="surface-card flex flex-col gap-4 p-[clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2rem)]">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="icon-pop flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-500/12 text-gold-500">
                  <Icon name={t.icon} class="h-5 w-5" />
                </span>
                <span class="section-index text-gold-500">{t.n}</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold leading-snug text-paper">{t.title}</h3>
              <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                {t.items.map((item) => (
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/65">
                    <span class="mt-[0.55rem] h-1 w-1 flex-none rounded-full bg-gold-500/70" aria-hidden="true" />
                    <span>{item}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  {/* The old /courses/ page's tabbed selector, moved here when Courses was
      folded into What We Teach. Same component, same content collection — the
      programs shown can't drift from the individual course pages. */}
  <ProgramSelector
    surface="gold"
    eyebrow="How It's Taught"
    title="Learn. Apply. Master."
    subtitle="Every topic above is delivered through three progressive programs. Each one is the next stage of becoming a professional trader — not a separate course."
  />

  {/* Prop-firm / funded-account training, pulled out of the sixteen-card grid
      into its own band. It's the outcome many students are actually here for,
      and it carries terms that shouldn't be reduced to a bullet. */}
  <section class="surface-ink py-section">
    <Container width="wide">
      <div class="grid items-start gap-x-[clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem)] gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]">
        <div data-reveal>
          <SectionHeading
            eyebrow="Funded Accounts"
            title="Prop Firm & Funded Account Training"
            align="left"
          />
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
            Proprietary trading firms let traders demonstrate skill through a paid evaluation,
            then trade firm capital. Most candidates fail on the risk rules — maximum daily loss,
            maximum drawdown, minimum trading days — rather than on the profit target. We prepare
            students for that reality, phase by phase, inside MDC3.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/55">
            We are an education provider. We do not operate a prop firm, provide funding
            ourselves, or guarantee that any student will pass an evaluation.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <Button href="/funded-account-training/" arrow>Funded account training</Button>
            <Button href="/partnerships/" variant="secondary">See our prop firm partners</Button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5" data-reveal>
          <div class="surface-card p-[clamp(1.5rem,2.5vw,2rem)]">
            <h3 class="eyebrow text-gold-500">What Evaluation Prep Covers</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2">
              {
                [
                  "Phase 1 & Phase 2 evaluations",
                  "Drawdown rules",
                  "Daily loss limits",
                  "Consistency rules",
                  "Risk scaling",
                  "Challenge planning",
                  "Trading journal discipline",
                  "Account management practices",
                ].map((item) => (
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
                    <Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-none text-gold-500" />
                    <span>{item}</span>
                  </li>
                ))
              }
            </ul>
          </div>

          {/* Same wording as the course pages — never "FREE $X account". */}
          <div class="surface-card-warm p-[clamp(1.5rem,2.5vw,2rem)]">
            <h3 class="eyebrow text-gold-400">Sponsored Evaluation Account</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/75">
              Eligible MDC2 and MDC3 students receive a sponsored prop firm evaluation account,
              subject to academy terms and partner availability.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="surface-gold py-section">
    <Container width="wide" class="flex flex-col gap-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)]">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Why Money Door"
        title="Why Learn With Money Door FX Academy?"
        align="left"
      />
      <ul class="grid gap-x-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)] gap-y-4 md:grid-cols-2" data-reveal-stagger>
        {
          whyChooseUs.map((point) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-paper/85">
              <Icon name="check-circle" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-none text-gold-500" />
              <span>{point}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="surface-ink-raised py-section">
    <Container width="wide" class="flex flex-col gap-8">
      <RiskDisclaimer variant="full" />
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,1.4rem+1.5vw,2.5rem)] font-medium text-paper">
          Ready to start learning?
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-lg text-base text-paper/70">
          MDC1 — Foundation Trader is free and takes one week. It's the place every Money Door
          student starts.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <Button href="/courses/mdc1/" arrow>Start with MDC1 (Free)</Button>
          <Button href="/join/" variant="secondary">Book Free Consultation</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
